external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">——</a>[9]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Belief-As-Attire\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">在这些情况下</a>[10]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Religions-Claim-To-Be-Non-Disprovable\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">，我们的信念</a>[11]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Fake-Explanations\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">看起来</a>[12]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Guessing-The-Teachers-Password\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">与证据的吻合度</a>[13]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Fake-Causality\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">，远比它们</a>[14]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Semantic-Stopsigns\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">实际上</a>[15]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/What-Is-Evidence\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">的吻合度</a>[16]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Mysterious-Answers-To-Mysterious-Questions\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">要高得多</a>[17]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/The-Futility-Of-Emergence\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">。</a>[18]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Say-Not-Complexity\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">而且我</a>[19]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Positive-Bias-Look-Into-The-Dark\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">也没有</a>[20]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/Knowing-About-Biases-Can-Hurt-People\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">过分强调</a>[21]<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.readthesequences.com/The-Bottom-Line\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">这一点</a>[22]。 …",
